//  only for discovery, not for trust."
// Optional endpoint-domain proof: publish
//   https://{endpoint-domain}/.well-known/agent-registration.json
// containing at least a `registrations` list matching the on-chain agent.
// NOTE: the A2A "0.3.0" and MCP "2025-06-18" versions in this example are stale
// (A2A is 1.0.1; MCP is 2026-07-28).

